{"seq":3,"slug":"curbside-wait-sla-failure-recovery","title":"取车等待 SLA 与失败恢复","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/bopis-curbside-pickup-store-fulfillment-orchestration/curbside-handoff-geofence/curbside-wait-sla-failure-recovery","wordCount":2800,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"取车等待-sla-与失败恢复\">取车等待 SLA 与失败恢复</h1><p>顾客按下「我到了」之后，系统才开始真正计时。这段从签到到货物交到手上的窗口，是整个路边取车履约中最难做一致性保证的一段——因为它的两端跨越了两个不受同一方控制的世界：门店内是店员有限的产能与不可并行的手工动作，门店外是顾客在车里不断累积的耐心。本文聚焦这条窗口的<strong>可度量、可承诺、可恢复</strong>三件事：如何定义等待、如何对等待设 SLA、以及当 SLA 注定被打破时系统如何优雅降级而不是无声失败。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>路边取车的等待时间不是一个单点数值，而是由若干可分离的时段拼接而成。工程上必须先把它<strong>拆成可归属的时间戳序列</strong>，否则任何 SLA 都只是口径不明的口号。业界通用的五个锚点：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>T0 到达/签到（arrival check-in）</strong>：围栏触发或顾客手动确认的瞬间（详见 ./1_curbside-arrival-geofence-checkin-model.md）。</li>\n<li><strong>T1 派单（dispatch）</strong>：订单被分配给某位店员并生成取车位的时刻（详见 ./2_handoff-identity-verification-queue-dispatch.md）。</li>\n<li><strong>T2 出货到车位（staging）</strong>：店员把包裹放到指定车位并标记「已就位」。</li>\n<li><strong>T3 核验通过（verification）</strong>：身份核验完成。</li>\n<li><strong>T4 交付关单（handoff complete）</strong>：订单状态机进入终态。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>顾客感知等待</strong>是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>Wait</mtext><mtext>perceived</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Wait}_{\\text{perceived}} = T_2 - T_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Wait</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">perceived</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，而<strong>店内可优化时间</strong>是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_2 - T_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。两者之差 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_1 - T_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 往往是最大的一段浪费——它被排队与派单延迟占据，却最容易被误记到「店员太慢」头上。把等待拆段的目的，正是让每一段都挂到能对它负责的那一方。</p>\n<p>等待 SLA 本身需要在<strong>承诺</strong>与<strong>观测</strong>之间分层，不能只有一个数字：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层级</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>典型口径</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>承诺 SLA（promised）</td>\n<td>对顾客可见的承诺</td>\n<td>「到店后 N 分钟内送达」</td>\n<td>顾客预期管理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>目标 SLA（target）</td>\n<td>内部运营目标</td>\n<td>各门店/时段分位数</td>\n<td>排班与产能规划</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>观测 SLA（observed）</td>\n<td>实际测量分位数</td>\n<td>全量时间戳计算</td>\n<td>评分、异常检测、复盘</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[T0 顾客签到] --&gt; B[T1 派单]&#10;  B --&gt; C{店员在岗?}&#10;  C --&gt;|否| D[排队等待/触发超时]&#10;  C --&gt;|是| E[T2 出货到车位]&#10;  E --&gt; F[T3 身份核验]&#10;  F --&gt;|通过| G[T4 交付关单]&#10;  F --&gt;|不通过| H[升级人工复核]&#10;  D --&gt;|超过阈值| I[降级: 转柜台自提/改约时段]&#10;  H --&gt; G&#10;  G --&gt; J[写入观测 SLA]&#10;  I --&gt; K[失败恢复流程]\">graph TD\n  A[T0 顾客签到] --&gt; B[T1 派单]\n  B --&gt; C{店员在岗?}\n  C --&gt;|否| D[排队等待/触发超时]\n  C --&gt;|是| E[T2 出货到车位]\n  E --&gt; F[T3 身份核验]\n  F --&gt;|通过| G[T4 交付关单]\n  F --&gt;|不通过| H[升级人工复核]\n  D --&gt;|超过阈值| I[降级: 转柜台自提/改约时段]\n  H --&gt; G\n  G --&gt; J[写入观测 SLA]\n  I --&gt; K[失败恢复流程]</pre><p>一个关键设计判断是：<strong>承诺 SLA 必须比目标 SLA 宽松</strong>，因为它是给顾客的对外契约，而目标 SLA 是内部追责线。把承诺直接等于目标，等于把每一次内部抖动都暴露成一次对外违约。同时要注意顾客等待的心理非线性——Maister 在 <em>The Psychology of Waiting Lines</em>（1985）中指出，<strong>不确定的等待比已知长度的等待更令人焦虑</strong>，被占用（occupied）的等待比空闲的等待更短感。这直接决定了两条工程实践：一是超时前必须主动告知「还需要 X 分钟」，二是等待期间要让顾客能看见进度（拣货中→已就位→店员已出发）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"超时检测与状态机\">超时检测与状态机</h2><p>等待 SLA 的失败几乎从不是「慢」这一个事件，而是<strong>一组状态的滞留</strong>。因此超时检测不能只对着 T0 设一个总闸，而要对每个状态设<strong>阶段超时（stage timeout）</strong>。核心状态机的每一步都必须有一个可触发的定时器，定时器到期进入对应的恢复分支。</p>\n<p>设某阶段起始时刻为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，该阶段允许的最长滞留为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mtext>stage</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta_{\\text{stage}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">stage</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则该阶段超时条件为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>now</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mtext>stage</mtext></msub><mo>⇒</mo><mtext>raise exception</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>stage</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{\\text{now}} - t_s &gt; \\Delta_{\\text{stage}} \\Rightarrow \\text{raise exception}(\\text{stage})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">now</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">stage</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⇒</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">raise exception</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">stage</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>超时值应来自<strong>实测分布</strong>而非拍脑袋。若某门店某时段的「派单→就位」时间分布中位数是 3 分钟、P95 是 8 分钟，那么把阶段超时设在 3 分钟会持续误报，设在 P99 又等于不报警。可用的做法是把超时设在该阶段 P95 与 P99 之间，并按门店、按小时段（高峰期/平峰）分别标定。<strong>超时不是凭感觉调的常数，而是随实测分布滚动的参数</strong>。</p>\n<p>阶段超时必须携带<strong>语义</strong>，因为不同阶段的失败含义完全不同：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>滞留阶段</th>\n<th>超时的实际含义</th>\n<th>恢复动作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>T0→T1 派单未发生</td>\n<td>产能不足或队列未消费</td>\n<td>升级派单优先级，或触发改约</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>T1→T2 就位未完成</td>\n<td>拣货异常/货品丢失/店员被打断</td>\n<td>重新指派，或核查库存</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>T2→T3 顾客未核验</td>\n<td>顾客不在车位、凭据不符</td>\n<td>主动外呼/推送确认位置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>T3→T4 关单未落</td>\n<td>系统写入失败（可能双写）</td>\n<td>幂等重试 + 对账</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>同时，超时检测本身要防<strong>重复触发</strong>：同一个滞留状态在连续多次扫描中会被反复发现。检测器必须对每个异常按 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>orderId</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>stage</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(\\text{orderId}, \\text{stage})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">orderId</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">stage</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 做<strong>去重与幂等</strong>，用「该阶段是否已存在未关闭的异常」。这与 Google SRE 中告警去重的思路一致——<strong>事件是事实，处置是有状态的动作</strong>，两者不可混同。</p>\n<h2 id=\"失败恢复的补偿与降级\">失败恢复的补偿与降级</h2><p>路边取车的失败恢复不能用事务回滚来理解，因为<strong>物理动作不可回滚</strong>：包裹已经出库、店员已经走了一趟、顾客已经在车里等了八分钟。正确的心智模型是 <strong>saga 的补偿（compensating action）</strong>——每完成一个前向步骤，就登记一个语义上的补偿，而不是撤销（来源：AWS Prescriptive Guidance <em>Saga pattern</em>；Chris Richardson <em>Microservices Patterns</em>）。补偿不是「当作没发生」，而是<strong>把系统导到一个可接受的替代终态</strong>。</p>\n<p>一个可落地的恢复策略阶梯，按代价从低到高：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>重试（retry）</strong>：仅适用于幂等且瞬时性失败，例如推送通知发送失败、状态写入的网络抖动。重试必须带退避与上限，且<strong>副作用动作（出货）绝不可盲目重试</strong>——一个超时不代表没发生。</li>\n<li><strong>重指派（reassign）</strong>：派单或就位阶段超时，把任务转给另一位店员；原店员的动作要么已完成（需对账识别），要么未开始（安全转移）。</li>\n<li><strong>降级交付通道（fallback channel）</strong>：店员无法及时到场时，把顾客从「车位等待」引导到「进店柜台自提」或「改为稍后配送」。这是最常见也最有效的恢复——<strong>顾客能接受替代方案，不能接受无人回应</strong>。</li>\n<li><strong>改约（reschedule）</strong>：门店产能彻底打满或货品缺失时，主动给出新的取货时间段并附带补偿（优惠券/免运费）。</li>\n<li><strong>人工介入（manual escalation）</strong>：所有自动路径失败时，转门店经理或客服工单，携带完整的阶段时间线，避免顾客向第二个渠道重复陈述。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>补偿必须记录的<strong>不是「失败」这个标签，而是失败发生在哪个已完成步骤之后</strong>。设已完成的前向步骤集合为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S = \\{s_1, \\dots, s_k\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span>，则补偿集合是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∣</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>∈</mo><mi>S</mi><mtext> 且 </mtext><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> 已定义</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\{c(s_i) \\mid s_i \\in S \\text{ 且 } c(s_i) \\text{ 已定义}\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6891em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">且</span><span class=\"mord\"> </span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">已定义</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span>，只对已登记的步骤执行补偿。这样即使恢复流程本身中断重试，也不会对同一物理动作补偿两次。</p>\n<p>状态写入的幂等同样是恢复的前提：交付关单涉及「订单状态 + 库存核销 + 支付结算」三处，任何一处成功而另一处超时，都会造成账实不符。唯一可靠的做法是<strong>幂等键 + 对账（reconciliation）</strong>——用订单号作为幂等键写入，并周期性对账「已交付订单」与「已核销库存」的差集。这与分布式系统的通用原则一致：<strong>超时意味着结果未知，不等于失败</strong>（来源：Google SRE Book，<em>Addressing Cascading Failures</em>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"度量-告警与复盘\">度量、告警与复盘</h2><p>要判断 SLA 是否被守住，必须用<strong>分位数而非平均值</strong>。平均等待时间会被大量「很快完成」的正常订单稀释，掩盖尾部顾客的糟糕体验。核心指标至少包括：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>各阶段时间差的 P50 / P95 / P99；</li>\n<li><strong>SLA 达成率</strong>——落到承诺窗口内的订单占比；</li>\n<li><strong>恢复成功率</strong>——进入恢复流程的订单中被成功导到替代终态的比例；</li>\n<li><strong>恢复耗时</strong>——从异常触发到订单落到终态的时间；</li>\n<li><strong>异常归因分布</strong>——按阶段与原因码聚合，用于产能与流程改进。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>与 Google SRE 的**错误预算（error budget）**思路对应：把「不达 SLA 的比例」当作可消耗的预算，一旦消耗过快就暂停新功能、优先修稳定性。对门店运营而言，等价的做法是当某门店某时段的 SLA 达成率跌破阈值时，<strong>自动收紧该门店的可承诺产能</strong>——减少线上可选的取车时段，而不是让顾客继续超时等待。这与本 hub 门店可承诺主题一脉相承：<strong>承诺能力必须由实测的履约能力反向约束</strong>。</p>\n<p>告警设计要区分<strong>症状告警</strong>与<strong>原因告警</strong>：对顾客而言的症状是「等待超时」，对门店而言的原因是「产能不足/拣货异常」。告警应以症状为准（顾客正在受损），以原因作为诊断附注，避免陷入「告警量巨大但顾客问题未被解决」的陷阱。</p>\n<p>复盘时最有价值的不是「哪一单超时了」，而是<strong>异常在阶段上的聚类</strong>。若某门店 P95 超时集中在 T1→T2，问题多半是拣货或找货；若集中在 T0→T1，则是派单与产能；若集中在 T2→T3，则是顾客沟通。归因到段，改进才会落到正确的责任方。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>路边取车的等待 SLA 与失败恢复，本质上是把一段<strong>跨系统、跨组织、不可回滚</strong>的过程变得可观测、可承诺、可收敛。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>等待必须<strong>拆成 T0–T4 时间戳序列</strong>，顾客感知等待（T2−T0）与店内可优化时间（T2−T1）是两回事。</li>\n<li>SLA 分<strong>承诺/目标/观测</strong>三层，承诺必须比目标宽松；顾客等待的心理非线性决定了「主动告知 + 进度可见」是硬要求。</li>\n<li>超时检测要<strong>按阶段</strong>设阈值并从实测分布滚动标定，异常按 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>orderId</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>stage</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(\\text{orderId}, \\text{stage})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">orderId</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">stage</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 去重幂等。</li>\n<li>失败恢复是 <strong>saga 补偿</strong>而非回滚：重试→重指派→降级通道→改约→人工介入，只对已登记的步骤补偿。</li>\n<li>状态写入靠<strong>幂等键 + 对账</strong>保证账实一致，因为超时只是「结果未知」。</li>\n<li>度量用<strong>分位数 + 错误预算</strong>，把不达 SLA 的比例当预算消耗，并让承诺产能被实测履约能力反向约束。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这套模型与相邻环节紧密咬合：等待的起点依赖地理围栏与签到的置信度（见 ./1_curbside-arrival-geofence-checkin-model.md），而派单与核验阶段的延迟正是等待的主体（见 ./2_handoff-identity-verification-queue-dispatch.md）。三者共同决定了路边取车这条「最后一公里」链路能否在顾客耐心耗尽前闭环。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"取车等待 SLA 与失败恢复","id":"取车等待-sla-与失败恢复"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"超时检测与状态机","id":"超时检测与状态机"},{"level":2,"text":"失败恢复的补偿与降级","id":"失败恢复的补偿与降级"},{"level":2,"text":"度量、告警与复盘","id":"度量-告警与复盘"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"交付身份核验与取车排队调度","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/bopis-curbside-pickup-store-fulfillment-orchestration/curbside-handoff-geofence/handoff-identity-verification-queue-dispatch"},"next":{"title":"门店产能与时段吞吐模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/bopis-curbside-pickup-store-fulfillment-orchestration/store-capacity-labor-exception/store-capacity-throughput-slot-model"}}